      "refersTo": "riva-dialog",
      "description": "Token-scoped information panel with a scrollable conversation and compact input.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-riva\" aria-label=\"RIVA\"><h2>RIVA</h2><p class=\"ds-riva-description\">Asisten informasi portofolio Rifqi.</p><div class=\"ds-messages\" role=\"log\"><p>Halo, saya RIVA. Saya bisa membantu mengenalkan pekerjaan Rifqi, keahlian, dan cara menghubunginya. Pilih topik atau tulis pertanyaanmu.</p></div><div class=\"ds-riva-shortcuts\"><button type=\"button\">xssscope</button><button type=\"button\">Apexsions</button><button type=\"button\">Keahlian</button><button type=\"button\">Kontak</button></div><form class=\"ds-riva-form\"><label class=\"ds-riva-label\" for=\"ds-riva-input\">Pertanyaan untuk RIVA</label><input id=\"ds-riva-input\" placeholder=\"Tanya tentang karya Rifqi\" maxlength=\"500\"/><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Kirim pertanyaan\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z\"/><path d=\"M22 2 11 13\"/></svg></button></form></section>",
      "css": ".ds-riva{width:min(410px,calc(100vw - 32px));height:min(570px,calc(100dvh - 110px));max-height:calc(100dvh - 110px);padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--site-line,#c9c3b4);border-radius:8px;background:var(--site-bg,#f1ece1);color:var(--site-ink,#10272e);font-family:Inter,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto auto minmax(65px,1fr) auto auto;gap:16px}.ds-riva h2{margin:0;font:400 18px \"Space Grotesk\",sans-serif}.ds-riva-description{font-size:14px;color:var(--site-muted,#536568);margin:0}.ds-messages{min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding-right:8px;font-size:13px}.ds-messages p{margin:0;padding:12px;background:var(--site-surface,#e4e0d4);border-radius:4px}.ds-messages p[data-from=user]{margin-left:30px;background:var(--site-metal,#725739);color:var(--site-bg,#f1ece1)}.ds-riva-form{display:flex;gap:8px}.ds-riva-label{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}.ds-riva-form input{min-width:0;flex:1;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--site-input,#8a8274);border-radius:3px;background:var(--site-bg,#f1ece1);color:var(--site-ink,#10272e);font:16px Inter,sans-serif}.ds-riva-form button{width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--site-metal,#725739);color:var(--site-bg,#f1ece1);border:0;border-radius:3px}.ds-riva-form svg{width:18px;height:18px}.ds-riva-form button:disabled{opacity:.5}.ds-riva-form input:focus-visible,.ds-riva-form button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--site-metal,#725739);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-riva-shortcuts{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px}.ds-riva-shortcuts button{font:inherit;background:transparent;border:0;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;min-height:40px}.ds-riva-shortcuts button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--site-metal,#725739);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-height:600px){.ds-riva{height:calc(100dvh - 24px);max-height:calc(100dvh - 24px);padding:18px;gap:10px;grid-template-rows:auto auto minmax(40px,1fr) auto auto}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Celah",
    "overview": "Two diagonal material planes open a narrow seam of light. This motif connects the cybersecurity hero to project artwork, while generous editorial spacing and restrained type keep the work readable. Rifqi is presented as a Cybersecurity Engineer; the official TembusMark and full name anchor the shared shell.\n\nThis system covers all public pages, case studies and errors. A route-scoped boundary contains its CSS variables, notification roots and portal host. Dialog, AlertDialog and Select portals inherit that scope. Exact `/admin` and `/auth` routes retain their legacy shell and root theme tokens; unknown nested paths use the public error design.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Petrol and warm ivory, with champagne or bronze interaction accents.",
      "Alternating editorial compositions and diagrams of documented work.",
      "Selectable, visible reading content with decorative motion around it."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Scope Rule",
        "body": "Apply Celah through the public boundary and its portal host; preserve the legacy root palette for admin and authentication.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep every public route and overlay in the Celah scope, with both themes and visible keyboard focus.",
      "**Do** keep Indonesian interface copy, the Cybersecurity Engineer role, and the official TembusMark geometry.",
      "**Do** preserve canonical project facts, names, IDs, technical terms, quantities and links from `src/data/projects.ts`; use `projectCopy.id.ts` for presentation text and preserve future CMS edits.",
      "**Do** keep reading content visible on first render and provide complete static compositions for mobile, short screens and reduced motion."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** apply the public theme to legacy admin/auth, or change contact payloads, validation, Turnstile, honeypot or timing contracts as a design edit.",
      "**Don't** invent screenshots, scanner output, logs, diffs, credentials, certifications or performance claims; project accomplishments remain separate from fetched certifications.",
      "**Don't** add replacement monograms, chapter/progress rails, global glitch effects or decorative mono labels.",
      "**Don't** treat source checks or generated component previews as visual approval; complete the documented browser review before releasing this revision."
    ]
  }
}
